      "independent_visual_review": "The specific prior defects are materially corrected at original output resolution: side/rear/silhouette show a blunt, smoothly rounded posterior rather than a sharp cone; top/hero/clay views show two genuinely separated parallel blunt papilla ridges, not one row of dots or walking legs; the annulated middle, short-spined anterior, papilla-bearing zone and smooth unspined rear have distinct structural cues. The single 25-spine proboscis ring and fine scalids remain at proboscis scale. Full smooth rear/anterior are visible without hiding cameras or material-only deception; no unsupported gill-function claim. Remaining limitations are ordinary schematic stylization, not the previous failure.",
